<title>UK: All three of today's Brent dates kept.</title>
<headline>All three of today's Brent dates kept.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three of the Brent dates due to turn wet today were kept by the equity holders, traders said.</p>
<p>J.P.Morgan and Phibro kept December 13-15 loading cargoes while Texaco kept a cargo deferred from Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Colin Wooster, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7456</p>
</text>
